# Vercel serves this repo with outputDirectory ".", i.e. the repo root is the
# web root. Without this file EVERYTHING is publicly fetchable — sample_data.zip
# (591 KB of CASIA images), docs/project_notes/, CLAUDE.md, the Python sources.
#
# Allowlist, not denylist: exclude everything, then re-admit only the two files
# the showcase page actually needs. Anything added to the repo later stays out
# of the deploy until it is named here on purpose.
*

# The showcase page — the Vercel app itself (vercel.json rewrites / to this).
!index.html

# Loaded by index.html in an iframe (<iframe src="carnival_wheel.html">).
# Also read at root by app.py, which is why it is not moved into a public/ dir.
!carnival_wheel.html

# Paper Trail — correction/rebuild pages. No corpus data is deployed.
!paper-catalog.html
!paper-trail-map.html

# Vercel's own config must reach the build for the rewrite rule to apply.
!vercel.json
